#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:87
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"valgrind\"/> (to run the tests), <xref linkend=\"gtk3\"/> "
"(to build the GUI event viewer), <xref linkend=\"libunwind\"/> (required for"
" tests), <xref linkend=\"libwacom\"/>, <xref linkend=\"doxygen\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"graphviz\"/>, <xref linkend=\"recommonmark\"/>, and <xref "
"linkend=\"sphinx_rtd_theme\"/> (required to build documentation), <xref "
"linkend=\"pyparsing\"/> (for one non-root test), and <xref "
"linkend=\"pytest\"/> (for another non-root test)"
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"valgrind\"/> (para executar os testes), <xref "
"linkend=\"gtk3\"/> (para construir o visualizador de eventos da GUI), <xref "
"linkend=\"libunwind\"/> (exigido para testes), <xref linkend=\"libwacom\"/>,"
" <xref linkend=\"doxygen\"/>, <xref linkend=\"graphviz\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"recommonmark\"/> e <xref linkend=\"sphinx_rtd_theme\"/> (exigido "
"para construir documentação), <xref linkend=\"pyparsing\"/> (para um teste "
"de não root), e <xref linkend=\"pytest\"/> (para outro teste de não root)"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:102
#, xml-text
msgid "Kernel Configuration for Running the Libinput Test Suite"
msgstr "Configuração do Núcleo para Executar a Suíte de Teste do Libinput"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:105
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Although libinput works with the same kernel configuration used by <xref "
"linkend=\"libevdev\"/>, its standard and more expansive test suite requires "
"the presence of <filename>/dev/uinput</filename> (as well as both <xref "
"linkend=\"valgrind\"/> and <xref linkend=\"libunwind\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"Embora a libinput funcione com a mesma configuração de núcleo usada pela "
"<xref linkend=\"libevdev\"/>, a suíte de teste padrão e mais abrangente dela"
" exige a presença de <filename>/dev/uinput</filename> (assim como <xref "
"linkend=\"valgrind\"/> e <xref linkend=\"libunwind\"/>)."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:112
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you wish to run the standard test suite, enable the following option in "
"the kernel configuration and recompile the kernel if necessary:"
msgstr ""
"Se você desejar executar a suíte padrão de teste, habilite a seguinte opção "
"na configuração do núcleo e recompile o núcleo se necessário:"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:122
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you build this as a module, it needs to be inserted before the test suite"
" runs."
msgstr ""
"Se você construir isso como um módulo, ele precisará ser inserido antes que "
"a suíte de teste execute."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:145
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Libinput"
msgstr "Instalação do Libinput"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:148
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>libinput</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>libinput</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:152
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..                  \\\n"
"      --prefix=$XORG_PREFIX     \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release       \\\n"
"      -D debug-gui=false        \\\n"
"      -D tests=false            \\\n"
"      -D libwacom=false         \\\n"
"      -D udev-dir=/usr/lib/udev &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..                  \\\n"
"      --prefix=$XORG_PREFIX     \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release       \\\n"
"      -D debug-gui=false        \\\n"
"      -D tests=false            \\\n"
"      -D libwacom=false         \\\n"
"      -D udev-dir=/usr/lib/udev &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><note><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:166
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you want to run the standard test suite, remove -D tests from the "
"<command>meson</command> command above. Please read <quote>Kernel "
"Configuration for Running the Libinput Test Suite</quote> (above)."
msgstr ""
"Se você quiser executar a suíte de teste padrão, remova -D tests do comando "
"<command>meson</command> acima. Por favor, leia <quote>Configuração do "
"Núcleo para Executar a Suíte de Teste da Libinput</quote> (acima)."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><note><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:172
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have decided the run the standard test suite, you can run the tests "
"<emphasis>as the root user</emphasis> by executing: <command>ninja "
"test</command>. There are over 30 tests and all should pass if you installed"
" the optional dependencies. However, you can run 6 minor tests as the "
"regular user by running the same command, although you will not need to "
"remove the -D tests parameter. The test measurements are based off of those "
"tests alone."
msgstr ""
"Se tiver decidido executar a suíte de teste padrão, você pode executar os "
"testes <emphasis>como o(a) usuário(a) root</emphasis> executando: "
"<command>ninja test</command>. Existem mais de 30 testes e todos deveriam "
"passar se você instalou as dependências opcionais. No entanto, você consegue"
" executar 6 testes menores como o(a) usuário(a) regular executando o mesmo "
"comando, embora você não precise remover o parâmetro -D tests. As medições "
"de teste são baseadas somente nesses testes."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:183
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:186
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:189
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have passed <option>-D documentation=true</option> to "
"<command>meson</command>, you can install the generated documentation by "
"running the following commands as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver passado <option>-D documentation=true</option> para "
"<command>meson</command>, você pode instalar a documentação gerada "
"executando os seguintes comandos como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#.  seems the api doc is not generated because the directory is not a git
#.      repository...
#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:198
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -dm755      /usr/share/doc/libinput-&libinput-version;/html &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -rv Documentation/* /usr/share/doc/libinput-&libinput-version;/html</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -dm755      /usr/share/doc/libinput-&libinput-version;/html &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -rv Documentation/* /usr/share/doc/libinput-&libinput-version;/html</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:204
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:210
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D debug-gui=false</parameter>: This switch disables creation of "
"a visual debug helper for libinput. Remove if you want it, and you have "
"<xref linkend=\"gtk3\"/> installed."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D debug-gui=false</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita a criação "
"de um auxiliar visual de depuração para libinput. Remova se o quiser e você "
"tiver o <xref linkend=\"gtk3\"/> instalado."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:216
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D tests=false</parameter>: This switch disables compilation of "
"the standard test suite. Even with the tests defined as false, you can still"
" run the first six minor tests as a regular user, but one will be skipped if"
" <xref linkend=\"pyparsing\"/> is not installed, and another one if <xref "
"linkend=\"pytest\"/> is not installed."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D tests=false</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita a compilação da"
" suíte de teste padrão. Mesmo com os testes definidos como false, você ainda"
" consegue executar os seis primeiros testes menores como um(a) usuário(a) "
"regular, mas um será ignorado se <xref linkend=\"pyparsing\"/> não estiver "
"instalado, e outro se <xref linkend=\"pytest\"/> não estiver instalado."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:224
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D libwacom=false</parameter>: Remove this option if you have "
"<xref linkend=\"libwacom\"/> installed, or if you are installing GNOME."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D libwacom=false</parameter>: Remova essa opção se você tiver "
"<xref linkend=\"libwacom\"/> instalado ou se estiver instalando o GNOME."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:230
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D udev-dir=/usr/lib/udev</parameter>: In case that the value of "
"<envar>XORG_PREFIX</envar> is not set to <filename "
"class='directory'>/usr</filename>, this option prevents the package from "
"installing Udev rules and helpers into <filename "
"class='directory'>$XORG_PREFIX/lib/udev</filename> which is not searched by "
"Udev daemon.  This option is not needed for systems with "
"<envar>XORG_PREFIX</envar> set to <filename "
"class='directory'>/usr</filename>, but does no harm."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D udev-dir=/usr/lib/udev</parameter>: Caso o valor de "
"<envar>XORG_PREFIX</envar> não esteja configurado como <filename "
"class='directory'>/usr</filename>, essa opção evita que o pacote instale "
"regras e auxiliares do Udev em <filename "
"class='directory'>$XORG_PREFIX/lib/udev</filename>, que não é pesquisado "
"pelo processo de segundo plano do Udev. Essa opção não é necessária para "
"sistemas com <envar>XORG_PREFIX</envar> configurado como <filename "
"class='directory'>/usr</filename>, mas não causa danos."

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/libinput.xml:241
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D documentation=true</option>: This switch enables generation of "
"the documentation. Add it if you want to generate the documentation. You "
"must have <xref linkend=\"doxygen\"/> and <xref linkend=\"graphviz\"/> "
"installed."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D documentation=true</option>: Essa chave habilita a geração da "
"documentação. Adicione-a se quiser gerar a documentação. Você precisa ter "
"<xref linkend=\"doxygen\"/> e <xref linkend=\"graphviz\"/> instalados."

